  (text "U6 (WeAct BlackPill STM32F411CEU6): Plugs into two 1x20 female headers. Not assembled by the factory - you buy and plug it\nR15 (33): Series resistors on fast clock lines: soften edges, less ringing/noise\nR16, R17, R18 (33): Resistor 0805 1%\nJ5 (UART): Debug serial port: connect a USB-serial adapter (its RX to pin 1)"
